{"page":416,"verses":[{"verse_key":"32:12","surah":32,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ تَرَىٰٓ إِذِ ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ نَاكِسُوا۟ رُءُوسِهِمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ رَبَّنَآ أَبْصَرْنَا وَسَمِعْنَا فَٱرْجِعْنَا نَعْمَلْ صَـٰلِحًا إِنَّا مُوقِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], if only you could see the wrongdoers hang their heads before their Lord: ‘Our Lord, now that we have seen and heard, send us back and we shall do good. [Now] we are convinced.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"you (could) see","transliteration":"tarā","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِذِ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhi","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","en_gloss":"the criminals","transliteration":"l-muj'rimūna","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَاكِسُوا۟","en_gloss":"(will) hang","transliteration":"nākisū","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رُءُوسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their heads","transliteration":"ruūsihim","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبَّنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَبْصَرْنَا","en_gloss":"we have seen","transliteration":"abṣarnā","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَسَمِعْنَا","en_gloss":"and we have heard","transliteration":"wasamiʿ'nā","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَٱرْجِعْنَا","en_gloss":"so return us","transliteration":"fa-ir'jiʿ'nā","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَعْمَلْ","en_gloss":"we will do","transliteration":"naʿmal","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًا","en_gloss":"righteous (deeds)","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"32:12"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مُوقِنُونَ","en_glos