sliteration":"wal-nāsi","verse_key":"32:13"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَجْمَعِينَ","en_gloss":"together","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","verse_key":"32:13"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"32:13"}]},{"verse_key":"32:14","surah":32,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"فَذُوقُوا۟ بِمَا نَسِيتُمْ لِقَآءَ يَوْمِكُمْ هَـٰذَآ إِنَّا نَسِينَـٰكُمْ ۖ وَذُوقُوا۟ عَذَابَ ٱلْخُلْدِ بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So since you ignored the meeting on this Day of yours, now We shall ignore you: taste the lasting suffering for all you have done.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"So taste","transliteration":"fadhūqū","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَسِيتُمْ","en_gloss":"you forgot","transliteration":"nasītum","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِقَآءَ","en_gloss":"(the) meeting","transliteration":"liqāa","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَوْمِكُمْ","en_gloss":"(of) this Day of yours","transliteration":"yawmikum","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ","en_gloss":"(of) this Day of yours","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَسِينَـٰكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"have forgotten you","transliteration":"nasīnākum","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And taste","transliteration":"wadhūqū","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَذَابَ","en_gloss":"(the) punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْخُلْدِ","en_gloss":"(of) eternity","transliteration":"l-khul'di","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used (to)","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"32:14"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"32:14"}]},{"verse_key":"32:15","surah":32,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا يُؤْمِنُ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا ٱلَّذِينَ إِذَا ذُكِّرُوا۟ بِهَا خَرُّوا۟ سُجَّدًا وَسَبَّحُوا۟ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّهِمْ وَهُمْ لَا يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ ۩","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The only people who truly believe in Our messages are those who, when they are reminded of them, bow down in worship, cele-brate their Lord’s praises, and do not think themselves above this.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minu","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"in Our Verses","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذُكِّرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they are reminded","transliteration":"dhukkirū","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَرُّوا۟","en_gloss":"fall down","transliteration":"kharrū","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سُجَّدًۭا","en_gloss":"prostrating","transliteration":"sujjadan","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَسَبَّحُوا۟","en_gloss":"and glorify","transliteration":"wasabbaḥū","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِحَمْدِ","en_gloss":"(the) praises","transliteration":"biḥamdi","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"are not arrogant","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ ۩","en_gloss":"are not arrogant","transliteration":"yastakbirūna","verse_key":"32:15"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"32:15"}]},{"verse_key":"32:16","surah":32,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"تَتَجَافَىٰ جُنُوبُهُمْ عَنِ ٱلْمَضَاجِعِ يَدْعُونَ رَبَّهُمْ خَوْفًا وَطَمَعًا وَمِمَّا رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ يُنفِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Their sides shun their beds in order to pray to their Lord in fear and hope; they give to others some of what We have given them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"تَتَجَافَىٰ","en_gloss":"Forsake","transliteration":"tatajāfā","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جُنُوبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their sides","transliteration":"junūbuhum","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَضَاجِعِ","en_gloss":"(their) beds","transliteration":"l-maḍājiʿi","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"they call","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَبَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbahum","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"خَوْفًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) fear","transliteration":"khawfan","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَطَمَعًۭا","en_gloss":"and hope","transliteration":"waṭamaʿan","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمِمَّا","en_gloss":"and out of what","transliteration":"wamimmā","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We have provided them","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُنفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"they spend","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","verse_key":"32:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"32:16"}]},{"verse_key":"32:17","surah":32,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَا تَعْلَمُ نَفْسٌ مَّآ أُخْفِىَ لَهُم مِّن قُرَّةِ أَعْيُنٍ جَزَآءًۢ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"No soul knows what joy is kept hidden in store for them as a reward for what they have done.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"taʿlamu","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَفْسٌۭ","en_gloss":"a soul","transliteration":"nafsun","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَّآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُخْفِىَ","en_gloss":"is hidden","transliteration":"ukh'fiya","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُرَّةِ","en_gloss":"(the) comfort","transliteration":"qurrati","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَعْيُنٍۢ","en_gloss":"(for) the eyes","transliteration":"aʿyunin","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَزَآءًۢ","en_gloss":"(as) a reward","transliteration":"jazāan","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used (to)","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"32:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"32:17"}]},{"verse_key":"32:18","surah":32,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَمَن كَانَ مُؤْمِنًا كَمَن كَانَ فَاسِقًا ۚ لَّا يَسْتَوُۥنَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So, is someone who believes equal to someone who defies God? No, they are not equal.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَن","en_gloss":"Then is one who","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"32:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"32:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُؤْمِنًۭا","en_gloss":"a believer","transliteration":"mu'minan","verse_key":"32:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَمَن","en_gloss":"like (him) who","transliteration":"kaman","verse_key":"32:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"32:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَاسِقًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"fāsiqan","verse_key":"32:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"32:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَسْتَوُۥنَ","en_gloss":"they are equal","transliteration":"yastawūna","verse_key":"32:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"32:18"}]},{"verse_key":"32:19","surah":32,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"أَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ فَلَهُمْ جَنَّـٰتُ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ نُزُلًۢا بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who believe and do good deeds will have Gardens awaiting them as their home and as a reward for what they have done.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمَّا","en_gloss":"As for","transliteration":"ammā","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"then for them","transliteration":"falahum","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتُ","en_gloss":"(are) Gardens","transliteration":"jannātu","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","en_gloss":"(of) Refuge","transliteration":"l-mawā","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نُزُلًۢا","en_gloss":"(as) hospitality","transliteration":"nuzulan","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used (to)","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"32:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"32:19"}]},{"verse_key":"32:20","surah":32,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ فَسَقُوا۟ فَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ ٱلنَّارُ ۖ كُلَّمَآ أَرَادُوٓا۟ أَن يَخْرُجُوا۟ مِنْهَآ أُعِيدُوا۟ فِيهَا وَقِيلَ لَهُمْ ذُوقُوا۟ عَذَابَ ٱلنَّارِ ٱلَّذِى كُنتُم بِهِۦ تُكَذِّبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who defy God, their home will be the Fire. Whenever they try to escape it, they will be driven back into it, and they will be told, ‘Taste the torment of the Fire, which you persistently denied.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَمَّا","en_gloss":"But as for","transliteration":"wa-ammā","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَسَقُوا۟","en_gloss":"are defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"fasaqū","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"then their refuge","transliteration":"famawāhumu","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنَّارُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāru","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كُلَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Every time","transliteration":"kullamā","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَرَادُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they wish","transliteration":"arādū","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَخْرُجُوا۟","en_gloss":"come out","transliteration":"yakhrujū","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنْهَآ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أُعِيدُوا۟","en_gloss":"they (will) be returned","transliteration":"uʿīdū","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَقِيلَ","en_gloss":"and it (will) be said","transliteration":"waqīla","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Taste","transliteration":"dhūqū","verse_key":"32:20"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَذَابَ","en_gloss":"(the) punishment","transliteration":"ʿ